.TH OMORFOS\-RELAY 1 "" omorfos "omorfos manual"
.nh
.ad l
.ds AD l
.SH NAME
omorfos\-relay \- Stands between Wayland programs and the omorfos compositor, so that the compositor can be started again without closing them
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBomorfos\-relay\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
It is started by omorfos\-hold, which hands it what it serves: there is no need to start it by hand.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
Print this help
.TP
\fB\-V, \-\-version\fR
Print the version
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBomorfos\fR(1), \fBomorfosctl\fR(1), \fBomorfos\-config\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-keys\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-rules\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-menu\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-theme\fR(5)
